; A chain of bound variables: a is twice k, b is a plus 1, other is three times j. The runtime
; tests check that a write to k recomputes a and b and leaves other alone. There is nothing to
; move here: the table shows the values.

(real k 1)
(real j 1)
(real a (* 2 k))
(real b (+ a 1))
(real other (* 3 j))
